    <reapack name="tRoshan Track Navigation" type="script" desc="Track Navigation - visibility-aware select, extend and shrink actions">
      <version name="2.0" author="tRoshan" time="2026-08-05T13:55:52Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[+ Bundled the track navigation actions into a single package sharing Functions/TrackNav.lua
+ Navigation now skips tracks hidden from the TCP and tracks inside fully collapsed folders
+ Scroll-into-view only fires when the target track is actually off-screen (uses js_ReaScriptAPI when present)
+ Replaces the standalone "Select Next Track And If No Track Available Insert One And Select It" package]]></changelog>
